t expose decay metadata as a symptom. Optional item-131-lin-766 is the actual single rounded stone, diameter 0.12 and recorded blunting 0.004; no striking, probing, prying or tool wear occurs in this assessment. Its geometry alone does not establish separation suitability. No support, clean receiver, water, heat, cutting edge or other stock is supplied or presumed. Execution costs one active round and 0.5 energy for nondamaging viewing and gentle whole-assembly reorientation; zero consumed materials. No travel, contact with the exposed interior, tasting, sniff challenge, pressing, further opening or separation is included. View only the represented exposed region and already represented exterior; never reveal the remaining interior. Reuse the existing resolution 0.02 and uncertainty 0.01 for supported body-scale geometry, explicitly distinguishing model assumptions from observations. The paid private report cites exact source revision, observation event, method, supplied complete evidence keys and their limitations. It distinguishes observed discontinuity/exposure from demonstrated detachability: an opening does not establish a free, graspable or detachable interior. Report accessibility, retention or clearance only where represented and actually observable; otherwise mark them unresolved. If current geometry cannot decide physical separability, return 'not established' and identify the missing source-specific accessibility/retention observation or bounded physical trial mechanism for development. Do not invent resistance, a successful hand method, mandatory cooking or a safety result. Before any later separation, require an independently implemented bounded method with actual suitable actuator/tool and reaction support where needed, reachable material-retaining receiver if required, exact source allocation, work/energy limits, failure response and fragment/residue conservation. Such a method must not reset or disguise the exhausted opening-contact limit. This release only assesses those prerequisites; it neither authorizes nor executes that later operation. Food-evidence conclusions remain unresolved unless complete applicable supplied evidence genuinely supports a narrower claim; source name, pale appearance, exposure, gathering history and engine eat availability do not prove identification, edible portion, safe condition, preparation sufficiency, toxin absence or nutrition. State which identification, condition and source-specific preparation evidence is absent without claiming that a hypothetical treatment would make it safe. Preserve the same item identity, quantity, location, ownership and processing, apart from ordinary ageing. No shell, kernel, debris, food, certificate or nutritional effect is created. Atomic implementation validates before charging and commits the paid observation/report together; interruption, cancellation or death before commit produces neither charge nor report, while completed effort is nonrefundable. No escrow or persistent work job exists, so no partial progress is credited and a retry is a fresh paid assessment. Death otherwise follows ordinary item ownership rules. No passive work, maintenance, automatic refresh, ingestion or world advancement during development/review waiting. Implement the validation, evidence restrictions, contact-limit guard and event/reward rules in code rather than requiring repeated model review. Full report remains Lin's own record; other participants must independently communicate and act.\\\",\\\"learning\\\":1,\\\"experienceReview\\\":\\\"Lin must study individually for one active round at 0.2 energy; registration and learning grant no mastery reward. Assessment provides no nutrition, health, physical comfort or automatic pleasure/satisfaction. A genuinely new verified observation, including an informative observed failure of accessibility, may invoke only the existing grounded-understanding rule: short source amount 0.8, cap 1, duration 8, cooldown 12; maintained